#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:118
msgid "Writing Unit Tests"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:120
msgid ""
":ref:`unit_testing` test cases can be added to a single file that may "
"include multiple tests. First of all, in this file, we need to add four "
"default functions: ``setUp``, ``tearDown``, ``setup`` and ``loop``. "
"Functions ``setUp`` and ``tearDown`` are used to initialize and finalize "
"test conditions. Implementations of these functions are not required for "
"running tests but if you need to initialize some variables before you run a "
"test, you use the ``setUp`` function and if you need to clean up variables "
"you use ``tearDown`` function. In our example we will use these functions to "
"accordingly initialize and deinitialize LED.  ``setup`` and ``loop`` "
"functions act as a simple Arduino program where we describe our test plan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:122
msgid ""
"Let's create ``test`` folder in the root of the project and add a new file "
"``test_main.cpp`` to this folder. Next basic tests for ``String`` class will "
"be implemented in this file:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:124
msgid "``test_string_concat`` tests the concatenation of two strings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:125
msgid ""
"``test_string_substring`` tests the correctness of the substring extraction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:126
msgid ""
"``test_string_index_of`` ensures that the string returns the correct index "
"of the specified symbol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:127
msgid ""
"``test_string_equal_ignore_case`` tests case-insensitive comparison of two "
"strings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:128
msgid "``test_string_to_upper_case`` tests upper-case conversion of the string"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:129
msgid ""
"``test_string_replace`` tests the correctness of the replacing operation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../tutorials/nordicnrf52/arduino_debugging_unit_testing.rst:132
msgid ""
"2 sec delay is required since the board doesn't support software resetting "
"via ``Serial.DTR/RTS``"
msgstr ""

